WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.525
SPEAKER: This
video shows you how

00:00:01.525 --> 00:00:02.850
to create a Qwiklabs account.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.642
You can skip this
section if you've already

00:00:04.642 --> 00:00:07.390
created a Qwiklabs account.

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:09.140
If you do not have
a Qwiklabs account,

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.750
you can create one now.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.522
If you already have
a Qwiklabs account,

00:00:12.522 --> 00:00:14.230
you can skip this
section and go directly

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:16.690
to the section about
redeeming credits.

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:20.710
In a web browser, navigate
to google.qwiklabs.com.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:24.160
On the Qwiklabs home
page, click Join.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.140
Click Join with Email.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.830
Enter your first and last
name and your email address.

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:31.750
Specify the same
email address that you

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:34.480
used for your Coursera account.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:39.490
For company name, specify your
institution's name, or none.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:41.230
Enter a password.

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:44.260
Enable the opt-in box to receive
additional Qwiklabs credits

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:47.270
after you complete the
cloud architecture quest.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.600
Enable the "I'm not
a robot" CAPTCHA,

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.530
and click Create a New Account.

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:52.030
Check?

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:54.280
Your email account for an
account confirmation email

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:56.200
from Qwiklabs.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:59.490
Click the link in the email
to confirm your account.

